$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> New Gaza" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Sandstorm" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Mid morning" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The world of New Gaza was assaulted by the <vServer::teamName1> 6 months ago and they are back to try to take it from the <vServer::teamName0> once more; much of the wreckage and ruins from the battle still litters the landscape. The <vServer::teamName0> have had 6 months to repair their facility, train new troops, and prepare for the next assault. The <vServer::teamName1> has learned from their last encounter and are sending in only the largest of their ships, holding the rest back in reserve. A small dust storm has just started and has cut down on visibility, but the battle for control of the planet is once more engaged and must go on as planned.";